ide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"111\" height=\"138\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cod Worm.png\" data-image-key=\"Cod_Worm.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/69/Cod_Worm.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821093117\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">20</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>221.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Womb\" title=\"Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Stage_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073122\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utero\" title=\"Utero\"><img alt=\"Stage Utero icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Utero icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Utero_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3d/Stage_Utero_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073102\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>A <b>Cod Worm</b> is a special variant of the &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Para-Bite\" title=\"Para-Bite\"><img alt=\"Para-Bite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Para-Bite.png\" data-image-key=\"Para-Bite.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/84/Para-Bite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20210821094012\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Para-Bite\" title=\"Para-Bite\">Para-Bite</a> in an immobile shell that can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chapter 4\">Chapter 4</a>. It was introduced in the vanilla content of <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a></i>.\n</p><p>Instead of chasing Isaac like the regular Para-Bites, the Cod Worm stays in its shell and will spew a burst of blood shots if shot at. After some time, it will reveal itself and become vulnerable to attacks.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6a/Edmund_McMillen_Rebirth_Monster_Sketches.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200820165725\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Sketches of monsters for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth, including the Cod Worm in the first rectangle of the fourth row, formerly called &quot;Blober.&quot; Coincidentally, the worm&#39;s appearance in the concept art resembles the &quot;Longit&quot; in the Legend of Bum-bo, another rentangle-shaped, legless monster.\"><img alt=\"Sketches of monsters for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth, including the Cod Worm in the first rectangle of the fourth row, formerly called &quot;Blober.&quot; Coincidentally, the worm&#39;s appearance in the concept art resembles the &quot;Longit&quot; in the Legend of Bum-bo, another rentangle-shaped, legless monster.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Edmund McMillen Rebirth Monster Sketches.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Edmund_McMillen_Rebirth_Monster_Sketches.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6a/Edmund_McMillen_Rebirth_Monster_Sketches.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20200820165725\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> Sketches of monsters for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth, including the Cod Worm in the first rectangle of the fourth row, formerly called \"Blober.\" Coincidentally, the worm's appearance in the concept art resembles the \"Longit\" in the Legend of Bum-bo, another rentangle-shaped, legless monster.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A cod worm is an aquatic parasite of marine fish.</li>\n<li>Cod worm has a resemblance to the Pokémon <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Shuckle_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\">Shuckle</a>.</li>\n<li>Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Booster_Packs#Booster_Pack_#5\" title=\"Booster Packs\">Booster Pack #5</a>, if a Cod Worm was killed before enemies finished spawning, the Cod Worm would die, even in its invincible form.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><d